<ServicePage
  serviceKey="storm"
  description="After rough weather, get a clear picture of your roof with photos and a written estimate."
  lede="After rough weather, get a clear picture of your roof and the work needed to protect your home."
  questions={['after-storm', 'storm-damage-signs', 'insurance-pay', 'file-claim', 'named-storm-deductible', 'nc-2027-changes']}
>
  <h2>Insurance claims</h2>
  <p>{facts.insuranceClaims.weDo} {facts.insuranceClaims.youDo}</p>
  <p>We can't promise what insurance will pay. We don't file, handle or negotiate claims.</p>
  <h2>Right after a storm</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Stay off the roof.</li>
    <li>If water is coming in, catch it, move what you can, and call us.</li>
    <li>Take photos of any damage you can see from the ground and inside.</li>
  </ul>
</ServicePage>
